{"id":"e7a06a0db4bcea18","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-Comprehension.md","title":"Comprehension Schema","display":"df-Comprehension — Comprehension Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-Comprehension","aliases":["62-df-Comprehension"],"display":"df-Comprehension — Comprehension Schema","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.4(iii)","source_pages":[4,5],"source_pdf_pages":[22,23]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-Comprehension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-Comprehension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-Comprehension — Comprehension Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.4(iii)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>4</span><span>5</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>22</span><span>23</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in V_N\">\\(n\\in V_N\\)</span> 固定；句法、自由变量与全称闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V_S\">\\(X\\in V_S\\)</span> 是各实例选择的新变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Comprehension}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\exists X\\,\\forall n(n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)):\\varphi\\in\\Gamma,\\ X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Comprehension}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\exists X\\,\\forall n(n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)):\\varphi\\in\\Gamma,\\ X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自由数参数和集合参数均由 UC 绑定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的自由出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 由内层全称量词绑定。新变量条件使用实际递归定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_2\\)</span>，代替原来没有正式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Par}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{Par}_2\\)</span>。这是元层句子集合，不是在对象语言内量化公式。更换归纳/理解的指定数变量只作合法变量重命名。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition I.2.4(iii)；纸面页 4, 5；PDF 页 22, 23。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}$，$n\\in V_N$ 固定；句法、自由变量与全称闭包见 [[62-df-L2]]。$X\\in V_S$ 是各实例选择的新变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Comprehension}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\exists X\\,\\forall n(n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)):\\varphi\\in\\Gamma,\\ X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Par}_2","display":false}],"bytes":1299,"backlinks":[{"id":"9ca697ca4459a05e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；理解模式生成算子见 [[62-df-Comprehension]]。"},{"id":"5a9c8f3ba52952bb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Pi1-formula]]，$\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Comprehension]]。"},{"id":"ce7850ab3516c1cc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基本公理见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]]，集合归纳见 [[62-df-set-induction]]，完整公式类和理解模式见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-Comprehension]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-Comprehension|Comprehension Schema]]"},{"id":"eddcc3574973d5b4","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论 $\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]；$\\mathsf{Range},\\mathrm{IR},\\mathrm{FR}$ 见 [[62-df-range-principles]]；$\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)$、$\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]、[[62-df-Comprehension]]；句法见 [[62-df-L2]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]，有限或单射枚举引理见 [[62-lem-RCA0-Sigma1-enumeration]]。"}],"outgoing":["4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}